msgid ""
"If this file is installed in SystemTap's tapset directory (e.g. ``/usr/share/"
"systemtap/tapset``), then these additional probepoints become available:"
msgstr ""
"Ist diese Datei im Tapset-Verzeichnis von SystemTap installiert (etwa ``/usr/"
"share/systemtap/tapset``), stehen diese zusätzlichen Probepoints bereit:"

#: ../../howto/instrumentation.rst:378
msgid ""
"This probe point indicates that execution of a Python function has begun. It "
"is only triggered for pure-Python (bytecode) functions."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Probepoint zeigt an, dass die Ausführung einer Python-Funktion "
"begonnen hat. Er wird nur für reine Python-Funktionen (Bytecode) ausgelöst."

#: ../../howto/instrumentation.rst:383
msgid ""
"This probe point is the converse of ``python.function.return``, and "
"indicates that execution of a Python function has ended (either via "
"``return``, or via an exception).  It is only triggered for pure-Python "
"(bytecode) functions."
msgstr ""

